  "catalog_course_description": "Fundamentals of electromagnetism. Elektrostatics. Boundary value problems. Magnetostatics. Time-dependent fields and Maxwell's equations. Propagation of electromagnetic waves. Wave guides and resonant cavities.",
  "course_learning_outcomes": [
    "Student will learn how to obtain the laws of classical electroynamics follow from Relativity."
  ],
  "course_objective": [
    "The students will learn how the laws of electromagnetism follow from relativity and gauge principles; will be able to solve related problems."
  ],
